        "Repeated pause, blur, hidden and pagehide stop all nodes; focus does not resume",
        "Read/write failures, corrupt prefs, unsupported audio and rejected resume do not throw into game",
        "Other-tab mute stops voices; remembered enable from another tab never arms page",
        "Mute during pending enable cannot be undone by asynchronous unlock",
        "Explicit game Continue resumes an interrupted armed context but never arms a fresh page"
      ]
    },
    {
      "passed": true,
      "groups": 5,
      "tests": [
        "Fortress single drain preserves renderer events; terminal overrides damage/pickup/hit and cannot repeat",
        "Fortress only actual damage, power and hit cue; shots/terrain/spawns remain silent",
        "Brook effective events coalesce and terminal settlement emits once; legacy sound no longer controls context",
        "Post free cues player gates/resets only, single legal finish or timeout, preserves reset cleanup",
        "Post cup cues player gates/resets only, single legal finish or timeout, preserves reset cleanup"
